    parentName: "pre",
    "className": "language-markdown"
  }, "I'm going to paste the text of an NLP paper here. then I'm going to ask you a series of questions about it. Let me know if there's information from tables or equations that you need or are missing and I will try to get it to a readable format for you. It's quite a long paper, so if it appears that it's been cut off midway through, feel free to ask for more before answering an questions (assuming your context window can handle more text). Here's the paper, and my first question about it is: what is this paper about?\n")), mdx("h4", {
